{{!< default}}
{{!-- The TFR rail, first on the page and pinned under the masthead as on the reader (Ian, 2026-09-23). --}}
{{> "faith-received/_tfr-rail"}}
{{#contentFor "moHead"}}
<title>Controversies | The Faith Received | Mere Orthodoxy</title>
<meta name="description" content="The controversies as the library's own controversy literature argued them, question by question: the schools (Thomas, Scotus, Suárez), Rome and the Reformation, the Reformed and their adversaries, the Lutherans and the Socinians, each side in his own words from the library's pages." />
<link rel=preconnect href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel=preconnect href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel=stylesheet href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=EB+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&family=Source+Serif+Pro:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&display=swap">
<style>
.tfr-tool{--bg:var(--color-bg,#F0F0ED);--fg:var(--color-dark,#1C1C1A);--muted:var(--color-muted,#5A5A56);--border:var(--color-rule,#D8D8D3);--card-bg:var(--color-card,#FFFFFF);--highlight:var(--color-highlight,#E7E7E2);--accent:var(--color-accent,#8A3B2E);--font-display:var(--font-display,"EB Garamond",Georgia,serif);--font-body:var(--font-body,"Source Serif Pro",Georgia,serif);--sans:var(--font-body,"Source Serif Pro",Georgia,serif)}
/* THE CONTROVERSIES (2026-10-21, owner: "as comprehensive and deep as possible, like being able to see differences between Thomas vs
   Scotus (like Juan de Rada shows) and more"). v1/enrich/controversies (runs/minimax_1019/controversies): a pair's controversies as the
   library's own controversy literature argued them, question by question, each side in his own words.
   ORGANIZED (2026-10-21, owner: "simply organize this as well … we want to see metaphysical questions and thomas vs scotists"): the
   works of controversy under four headings, each with a label naming both sides and the work; one row grammar for the view (a label,
   the text, the page at the right): position, arguments, own words, judgment. One type scale: secondary .8rem, body 1rem, headings
   1.25 / 1.6 / 2rem. */
.tfr-tool *{box-sizing:border-box}
.tfr-tool a{color:var(--fg)}
.tfr-tool :is(a,button,summary,input):focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--fg);outline-offset:2px}
.tfr-tool .wrap{max-width:66rem;margin:0 auto;padding:1.8rem 1.2rem 4rem}
.tfr-tool h1{font:500 2rem/1.2 var(--font-display);margin:.2rem 0 .6rem;text-wrap:balance}
.tfr-tool .lede{max-width:70ch;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 1.2rem;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .ct{color:var(--muted);font:400 .8rem/1.3 var(--sans);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}
.tfr-tool .sr{position:absolute;left:-9999px}
.tfr-tool .pairs{margin:0 0 1.6rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.tfr-tool .pairs>summary{cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.55rem;padding:.65rem .1rem;font:500 1rem/1.3 var(--font-display)}
.tfr-tool .pairs>summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.tfr-tool .pairs>summary>span:first-child{flex:none;white-space:nowrap}
.tfr-tool .pairs>summary::after{content:"";flex:none;width:.42rem;height:.42rem;border-right:1.5px solid currentColor;border-bottom:1.5px solid currentColor;transform:translateY(-.15rem) rotate(45deg);margin-left:.15rem}
.tfr-tool .pairs[open]>summary::after{transform:translateY(.1rem) rotate(-135deg)}
.tfr-tool .pairs>summary .cur{margin-left:auto;color:var(--muted);font:1rem/1.3 var(--font-body);text-align:right;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;min-width:0}
.tfr-tool .pairs[open]>summary .cur{display:none}
.tfr-tool .pg-groups{columns:17rem 3;column-gap:2.2rem;padding:.2rem 0 .8rem}
.tfr-tool .pg-group{break-inside:avoid;margin:0 0 1.2rem}
.tfr-tool .pg-group h2{font:500 1.25rem/1.3 var(--font-display);margin:0 0 .25rem;padding-bottom:.3rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);text-wrap:balance}
.tfr-tool .pg-group ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
.tfr-tool .pg-group a.pl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:.8rem;align-items:baseline;padding:.42rem .5rem;margin:0 -.5rem;border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--fg);font:1rem/1.35 var(--font-body);text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .pg-group a.pl:hover{background:var(--highlight)}
.tfr-tool .pg-group a.pl small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:.8rem;margin-top:.1rem}
.tfr-tool .pg-group a.pl[aria-current="page"]{background:var(--fg);color:var(--bg)}
.tfr-tool .pg-group a.pl[aria-current="page"] :is(small,.ct){color:inherit;opacity:.8}
.tfr-tool .pg-also{margin:.1rem 0 .45rem;font-size:.8rem;line-height:1.5;color:var(--muted);text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .pg-also a{color:var(--fg)}
.tfr-tool .pair{margin:0 0 1.4rem}
.tfr-tool .pair h2{font:500 1.6rem/1.25 var(--font-display);margin:0 0 .45rem;text-wrap:balance}
.tfr-tool .pair h2 .ct{margin-left:.4rem}
.tfr-tool .lab{display:grid;grid-template-columns:max-content minmax(0,1fr);gap:.3rem 1.1rem;margin:0;max-width:72ch}
.tfr-tool .lab>div{display:contents}
.tfr-tool .lab dt{color:var(--muted);font:600 .8rem/1.95 var(--sans)}
.tfr-tool .lab dd{margin:0;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(15rem,21rem) minmax(0,1fr);gap:1.8rem;align-items:start}
.tfr-tool .nav{position:sticky;top:.8rem;max-height:calc(100vh - 1.6rem);overflow:auto}
.tfr-tool .find{width:100%;padding:.5rem .7rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;background:var(--card-bg);color:var(--fg);font:1rem var(--font-body);margin:0 0 .6rem}
.tfr-tool .find::placeholder{color:var(--muted)}
.tfr-tool .chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.35rem;margin:0 0 .8rem}
.tfr-tool .chips button{border:1px solid var(--border);background:var(--card-bg);color:var(--fg);padding:.25rem .65rem;border-radius:999px;font:600 .8rem/1.2 var(--sans);cursor:pointer}
.tfr-tool .chips button[aria-pressed="true"]{background:var(--fg);color:var(--bg);border-color:var(--fg)}
.tfr-tool .chips button[aria-pressed="true"] .ct{color:inherit}
.tfr-tool .books{margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
.tfr-tool .books details{border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.tfr-tool .books summary{cursor:pointer;padding:.55rem .2rem;font:500 1rem/1.3 var(--font-display);list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:.5rem}
.tfr-tool .books summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.tfr-tool .books summary small{color:var(--muted);font:.8rem/1.3 var(--sans)}
.tfr-tool .books ul{list-style:none;margin:0 0 .6rem;padding:0}
.tfr-tool .books li button{display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;padding:.4rem .3rem .4rem .8rem;border:0;background:none;color:var(--fg);font:1rem/1.35 var(--font-body);cursor:pointer;border-radius:4px;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .books li button:hover{background:var(--highlight)}
.tfr-tool .books li button[aria-current="true"]{background:var(--fg);color:var(--bg)}
.tfr-tool .books li button small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font:.8rem/1.3 var(--sans)}
.tfr-tool .books li button[aria-current="true"] small{color:inherit;opacity:.8}
.tfr-tool .c-head h2{font:500 1.6rem/1.25 var(--font-display);margin:0 0 .6rem;text-wrap:balance}
.tfr-tool .c-head .lab{max-width:none}
.tfr-tool .kind{display:inline-block;padding:.05rem .55rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:999px;font:600 .8rem/1.5 var(--sans)}
.tfr-tool .pg{font-size:.8rem;white-space:nowrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.tfr-tool .r1{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:.4rem 1rem}
.tfr-tool .r1>span{min-width:0}
.tfr-tool .fold{margin:.7rem 0 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.tfr-tool .fold>summary{cursor:pointer;padding:.45rem 0;font:600 .8rem/1.4 var(--sans);color:var(--muted);list-style:none}
.tfr-tool .fold>summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.tfr-tool .fold>summary::before{content:"+";display:inline-block;width:1rem;font-weight:400}
.tfr-tool .fold[open]>summary::before{content:"\2212"}
.tfr-tool .rows{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}
.tfr-tool .rows>li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:.2rem 1rem;align-items:baseline;padding:.45rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border);text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .rows>li:first-child{border-top:0}
.tfr-tool .fold .rows{margin:0 0 .5rem}
.tfr-tool .sides{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1.6rem;margin:1.4rem 0 1rem}
.tfr-tool .side h3{font:500 1.25rem/1.3 var(--font-display);margin:0 0 .2rem;padding-bottom:.3rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--fg);text-wrap:balance}
.tfr-tool .side h3.long{font-size:1rem;line-height:1.4}
.tfr-tool .side h4{font:600 .8rem/1.4 var(--sans);color:var(--muted);margin:1rem 0 .3rem;display:flex;gap:.4rem;align-items:baseline}
.tfr-tool .side .pos{margin:0;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool ol.args{counter-reset:arg}
.tfr-tool ol.args>li{grid-template-columns:1rem minmax(0,1fr) auto;column-gap:.6rem}
.tfr-tool ol.args>li::before{counter-increment:arg;content:counter(arg);color:var(--muted);font:600 .8rem/1.6 var(--sans);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.tfr-tool .gist{margin:0 0 .6rem;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool figure.own{margin:0 0 .9rem}
.tfr-tool figure.own blockquote{margin:0;padding:0 0 0 .85rem;border-left:1px solid var(--muted);font-style:italic;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool figure.own blockquote p{margin:0}
.tfr-tool figure.own figcaption{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:.3rem 1rem;margin:.3rem 0 0 .85rem;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted)}
.tfr-tool figure.own .says{margin:.25rem 0 0 .85rem;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .judgment{margin:1.2rem 0 0;padding:1rem 1.1rem;background:var(--card-bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px}
.tfr-tool .judgment h3{font:500 1.25rem/1.3 var(--font-display);margin:0 0 .35rem}
.tfr-tool .judgment .r1 p{margin:0;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .across{margin:1.4rem 0 0;padding:1rem 1.1rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px}
.tfr-tool .across h3{font:500 1.25rem/1.3 var(--font-display);margin:0 0 .2rem}
.tfr-tool .across-q{margin:0 0 .7rem;text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .across-pos{list-style:none;margin:0 0 .7rem;padding:0;display:grid;gap:.4rem}
.tfr-tool .across-pos li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(10rem,22rem) 1fr 2.5rem;gap:.6rem;align-items:center}
.tfr-tool .ap-bar{display:block;height:8px;background:var(--highlight);border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden}
.tfr-tool .ap-bar i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--fg);opacity:.75}
.tfr-tool .ap-n{text-align:right;color:var(--muted);font-size:.8rem;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
.tfr-tool .across-links{margin:0;font-size:.8rem}
.tfr-tool .next{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;margin:1.6rem 0 0;padding-top:.8rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border);font-size:.8rem}
.tfr-tool .next button{border:0;background:none;color:var(--fg);font:inherit;cursor:pointer;padding:.2rem 0;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;text-align:left}
.tfr-tool .next button+button,.tfr-tool .next span+button{text-align:right}
.tfr-tool .note{max-width:72ch;margin:2rem 0 0;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);text-wrap:pretty}
.tfr-tool .muted{color:var(--muted)}
@media (max-width:760px){.tfr-tool .wrap{padding:1.2rem 1rem 3rem}
.tfr-tool h1{font-size:1.6rem}
.tfr-tool .pair h2,.tfr-tool .c-head h2{font-size:1.25rem}
.tfr-tool .cols{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:1.2rem}
.tfr-tool .nav{position:static;max-height:none;overflow:visible}
.tfr-tool .books{max-height:min(55vh,24rem);overflow:auto;overscroll-behavior:contain;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}
.tfr-tool .sides{grid-template-columns:1fr}
.tfr-tool .lab{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}
.tfr-tool .lab dd{margin-bottom:.35rem}
.tfr-tool .across-pos li{grid-template-columns:1fr 2.5rem}
.tfr-tool .across-pos .ap-bar{grid-column:1/-1;grid-row:2}
.tfr-tool .next{flex-direction:column}
.tfr-tool .next button+button,.tfr-tool .next span+button{text-align:left}}
</style>
{{/contentFor}}
{{!-- /the-faith-received/controversies/: the controversies, as The Faith Received has them (tools/prdl_reader_prototype/controversies.html, 2026-10-21):
     a pair's controversies read whole from the work that argued them (Juan de Rada's Controversiae; Capreolus's Defensiones; Turretin's
     Institutio), each side's position and arguments with the work's page, its judgment, and each side in his own words from the pages
     of his works (v1/enrich/controversies on the library worker). The hero is the theme's; the body and faith-controversies.js the library's. --}}
<section class="bhero bhero--tool">
  <div class="bhero-inner container">
    <p class="bhero-kicker"><a href="/the-faith-received/">The Faith Received</a> <span aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span> Controversies</p>
    <h1 class="bhero-title">The controversies</h1>
    <p class="bhero-lede">Two authorities set against each other question by question, as the library's own controversy literature argued them: each side's position and arguments as the work states them, the work's judgment, and each side in his own words from the pages of his works.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<script src="{{asset "js/page/faith-tfr-rail.js"}}" defer></script>
<main class="tfr-tool"><div class="wrap">
    <p class="lede" id="lede" hidden>The disputes between two authorities as the library's own controversy literature argued them, question by question: each side's position and arguments as the work states them, the work's judgment, and each side in his own words from the pages of his works.</p>
  <div id="pairs"></div>
  <section class="pair" id="src" aria-labelledby="pairH"></section>
  <div class="cols">
    <nav class="nav" aria-label="The controversies of this work">
      <input class="find" id="find" type="search" placeholder="Find a controversy" aria-label="Find a controversy" autocomplete="off">
      <div class="chips" id="chips" role="group" aria-label="Kind of difference"></div>
      <ol class="books" id="books"><li class="muted">Loading…</li></ol>
    </nav>
    <article class="c" id="c" aria-live="polite"></article>
  </div>
  <p class="note" id="note"></p>
</div></main>
<script src="{{asset "js/faith-controversies.js"}}&amp;frv=343dceb450131b51"></script>
